                                "sense_id": "0e9b680a-bc71-3a20-8f8b-02ddabea838a",
                                "text": "The Kroger supermarket chain […] agreed to weigh out dieters as well as their vegetables. Some 12,000 hopeful pound shuckers herded through the chain’s groceries during the first weekend."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "927f4f31-b1db-3867-ac11-9a0335855ac7",
                        "entry_id": "e838452d-c6d1-3173-84e9-47a230dab6f4",
                        "glosses": [
                            "A device that shucks produce, such as a corn shucker."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "2227d7d0-7f43-423a-8db1-394b5e41c951",
                                "sense_id": "927f4f31-b1db-3867-ac11-9a0335855ac7",
                                "text": "Friends with powerful connections helped him get a corn shucker; he knows of 80 other farmers who are on the waiting list for those machines in a region that is to receive only four during the next two years."
